TMF-27 SplitTryte Math & Science Bank v1.0

Specialized math, set theory, relational logic symbols, subscripts and superscripts for Trinary Math operations.

[LAYOUT]
splitTryte = [11|BANK_L|VAL_L2|VAL_L1|VAL_L0|BANK_R|VAL_R2|VAL_R1|VAL_R0]
standard_marker = 11

[DESIGN_RULES]

1. Every splitTryte stores two self-contained symbols.
2. No shift/caps state is required for uppercase/lowercase.
3. BANK:+ is Math Primitives / Core Operations & Constants.
4. BANK:- is Math Operators & Advanced Calculus / Linear Algebra / Logic.
5. BANK:0 is Alternative Math Numbers & Super/Sub-scripts.
6. Full pair table is generated by crossing every left symbol against every right symbol.

[BANK_LANES]

+ = UPPER_ALPHA          = 10
- = LOWER_ALPHA          = 00
0 = NETIV_NUMERIC_SYMBOL = 01

